## Fallback stub for `extra_greeting` when the `extras` feature is disabled.
##
## Rebuild with default features (or `--features extras`) for the full
## implementation in `src/core/extras.alya`.
@cfg(not(feature = "extras"))
pub function extra_greeting(name = "World") -> string
    throw "extras feature is disabled (rebuild with default features or --features extras)"
end
